---
title: Curry Chicken, Chickpeas and Cauliflower
source: claude
servings: 4
tags: [freezer, sheet-pan]
cook time: 25-35 minutes
---

> About 11 g fiber and 38 g protein per serving. If frozen, thaw before roasting.

Heat the oven to 425°F.

Toss @chicken thigh{2%lb}, @chickpeas{30%oz}(drained and patted dry), @cauliflower{1%head}(cut into florets) and @red onion{1}(cut into wedges) with @olive oil{2%tbsp}, @curry powder{2%tbsp} and @salt{1%tsp}.

Spread on a #sheet pan{} and roast for ~{25-35%minutes}, until the chicken is cooked through.
